  lead: 'Find out exactly what any appliance costs to run with this <strong>electricity cost calculator</strong>. Because you enter your own price per kWh straight off your utility bill, the daily, monthly, and yearly figures reflect <em>your</em> real cost — not a generic national average that may be double or half what you actually pay.',
