  metaDesc: 'Convert kilowatt-hours to dollars. Enter kWh used and your rate to get the exact cost, plus monthly and yearly projections if that usage repeats daily.',
  keywords: ['kwh cost calculator', 'cost per kwh calculator', 'watt to kwh cost calculator', 'kilowatt hour cost calculator', 'kwh to dollars calculator'],
  formulaPill: 'Cost = kWh × rate',
  lead: 'Turn kilowatt-hours into dollars with this simple <strong>kWh cost calculator</strong>. Enter the energy used and your own price per kWh and get the exact cost. If that amount of energy is used every day, the tool also projects the monthly and yearly totals — all based on the rate you actually pay, not a national average.',
  reviewed: 'September 5, 2026',
