  methodology: 'The calculator multiplies the entered energy in kilowatt-hours by your electricity rate in dollars per kWh to return the cost. Treating the entered amount as a daily figure, it also projects monthly (×30) and yearly (×365) costs, giving a fast way to scale a single reading into a budget using your own price.',
